        "rationale": "The reply connects the blank `GH_TOKEN:` in the v1.3.0/v1.4.0 logs, the misnamed secret and the one-line fix. It also cites the workflow comment on why GITHUB_TOKEN would not trigger Docs, which covers why gh's github.token hint does not apply, though only implicitly. However, it names only RELEASE_NOTES_PAT and never lists PACKAGE_REGISTRY_PAT, so the reply-names-both-secrets check fails. That caps explanation at 4."
